{"3967860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rasen", "steam_appid": 3967860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4975200], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the blade in your own way.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight flawlessly through chaotic battles among lethal vagabonds in a world caught in an endless spiral of death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PvP &amp; PvE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, face other players, or take on challenging AI in atmospheric duels, clashes, deathmatches and more with up to 8 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skill in ranked matches and continue your path toward the strongest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GGPO-style rollback netcode keeps combat responsive, even at higher ping.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/ba4bd06409a8e43ca5c1f78527a5a38a.poster.avif?t=1787750763\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/ba4bd06409a8e43ca5c1f78527a5a38a.webm?t=1787750763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/ba4bd06409a8e43ca5c1f78527a5a38a.mp4?t=1787750763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Defend with intent</strong>: Parry, block, dodge, or sidestep to avoid taking damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strike with precision: </strong>Time attacks and chain abilities to break an opponent’s guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seize the moment: </strong>Find openings, match the timing and interrupt the incoming hit with a precise counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Exchange: </strong>Feign, bait and read the enemy, bending the fight to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/9c6ea661032bf1951355b426117f88d6.poster.avif?t=1787750763\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/9c6ea661032bf1951355b426117f88d6.webm?t=1787750763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/9c6ea661032bf1951355b426117f88d6.mp4?t=1787750763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Beast Mode: </strong>Enter a state of lethal focus, empowering your abilities with deadly moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/9438cc807d305a3477ae95799b65ee70.poster.avif?t=1787750763\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/9438cc807d305a3477ae95799b65ee70.webm?t=1787750763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967860/extras/9438cc807d305a3477ae95799b65ee70.mp4?t=1787750763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face overwhelming odds:</strong> Battle multiple enemies at once, combine skill and strategy to overcome intense encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><